==Battleground==
*3 [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuus]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Rei (Enemy)|Reis]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*3 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wyvern (Enemy)|Wyvern]] spawns as the boss after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Rei (Enemy)|Reis]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spammable attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Mer-Cat]] along with 3 meatshields should be all you need.

